$Notes:
Generated by tools/missions/AutotestPad.ps1; edit that, not this file.
Autotest test of the control pad. The player is alone with a buoy; a scripted pad taps a button,
holds and releases fire, and moves the sticks and a trigger, and the game checks the pad's output
each frame against known answers (code/Replay/InputTest.h).
autotest: pad script
autotest: player stays still
Run with -at_input pad -at_pilot AutotestPilot -NoPlayerNpc -at_time 20 (the new scratch pilot has the default controls).
$End Notes:

$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("Autotest pad", -1)
